{"u": "10770463307", "name": "Stop The Tsunami!", "place": "71586501620185", "created": "2026-10-12", "updated": "2026-11-18T16:01:12.063Z", "genre": "", "subgenre": "", "desc": "🌊 A GIANT TSUNAMI IS COMING. Build the defences that keep the town dry!\n\nDig sand, pile it into walls, carve trenches and pack them hard. Then press START ROUND and watch the wave hit. Every wave you hold back pays coins, so upgrade and build bigger for the next one.\n\n🏖️ HOLD THE BEACH\nClear a stage and the sea pulls back. The beach gets wider and the waves get bigger. Can you save the town all the way to the end?\n\n🚜 FROM SPADE TO EXCAVATOR\nStart with a toy spade, then work up to shovels, a bulldozer, a skid steer, excavators and a dump truck.\n\n🪨 LATE-GAME MATERIALS\nOn the full beach, haul gravel, drop boulders, sculpt clay and pour concrete for walls that can take a monster wave.\n\n👥 PLAY WITH FRIENDS\nShare one coin wallet and every machine. One digs, one drives, one patches the wall mid-wave!\n\n⭐ Easy, Medium and Hard modes\n🎁 Daily Spin and daily rewards\n🏖️ Join the Beach Club group for a free Rewind!", "desc_hash": "57eced0fd71d", "max_players": 16, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 18859817, "favorites": 299898, "creator": {"id": 672866780, "name": "Beach Defenders!", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-12": {"updated": "2026-11-11T02:16:37.671Z", "visits": 1504452, "fav": 26273, "up": 270, "down": 152}, "2026-11-13": {"updated": "2026-11-13T16:38:16.692Z", "visits": 3216986, "fav": 59180, "up": 606, "down": 301}, "2026-11-14": {"updated": "2026-11-14T13:52:54.824Z", "visits": 7148422, "fav": 128937, "up": 3117, "down": 625}, "2026-11-15": {"updated": "2026-11-15T03:56:52.992Z", "visits": 11267995, "fav": 191403, "up": 5829, "down": 950}, "2026-11-16": {"updated": "2026-11-15T03:56:52.992Z", "visits": 13632636, "fav": 225353, "up": 7576, "down": 1109}, "2026-11-17": {"updated": "2026-11-17T05:35:51.08Z", "visits": 16161560